  "description": "FunkyORM, a lightweight micro-ORM designed for simplicity and speed. Enables intuitive lambda-style queries and leverages conventions alongside annotations for seamless mappings. Features minimal setup, a gentle learning curve, and blazing-fast runtime performance. Includes the SQL Server, PostgreSQL, MySQL and SQLite providers for .NET 8 and .NET Standard 2.0; the .NET Framework 4.8 (net48) build carries the SQL Server provider only.",
